# secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# .env.tpl holds op:// references only, never values - it is the input to
# 'op inject' in the deploy workflow. Gitleaks is the backstop if a real value
# ever lands in one.
!**/.env.tpl
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
*secret*
